# Trace discussions on issues and PRs

When a conversation in Cursor changes an issue or pull request (implementation decisions, rebases, scope changes, acceptance clarifications, follow-ups), leave a short comment on that issue or PR summarizing what was decided or done.

Do this without being asked when the change is material to future readers. Prefer one clear comment over repeating the same summary.
